  "title": "Undertale",
  "description": "Minecraft Full Undertale map Experience (Part 1-2)",
  "body": "**This is a fully functional Minecraft recreation of Undertale!**\n_(Part 1-2 of 6)_\n\n![Undertale Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cdec457b31c251e28ac8facfedb3a7a30895cfd7.png)\n\n-------------------------------\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Hh8I23zEBsQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n# This beta contains the **RUINS & SNOWDIN**.\nIncluding:\n- 18 Enemy Types\n- 5 Boss Fights\n- 17 Different Encounter Types\n- 8 Routes\n- All Items\n- Full Story\n- All Easter Eggs\n- Customizable Soul Color\n- Voice Acting\n- Custom Skin Support\n- Custom Models, Builds, & Animations\n- And so much more!\n\n-------------------------------\n\n# Credits:\n## Main Team:\n- [Clouser](https://www.youtube.com/c/C1OUS3R)\n- [NoteBlockMatt](https://www.youtube.com/@NoteBlockMatt)\n- [Mortimer Kerman](https://mortimer-kerman.github.io/?lang=en)\n- [AshIsReal](https://x.com/Ash_is_real)\n- [Tem4ik](https://boosty.to/t4mka)\n- [NukeBob](https://www.youtube.com/@Nukebob3)\n- [SnaveSutit](https://snavesutit.github.io/)\n## Specil Thanks\n- [AnimalMace](https://www.youtube.com/@animalmace)\n- [Shayy](https://www.youtube.com/@ShayyTV)\n- [OceanBagel](https://www.youtube.com/@OceanBagel)\n- [Kyle(Pink Sheep)](https://www.youtube.com/@PinkSheep)\n- [AWML](https://www.youtube.com/@AWMLGaming)\n- [MrMinerMan21](https://x.com/mrminerman21)\n- [KaiCoyote](https://modrinth.com/mod/crops-n-corpses/version/0.2.0)\n- [MangoJuice](https://www.youtube.com/@mangojuiceost)\n- [Powpow](https://x.com/powpowwwwwww)\n- [Loot Labs](https://lootlabs.gg/)\n- [SamGladiator](https://www.youtube.com/@samgladiator)\n## Play Testers:\n- NoteBlockMatt\n- MangoJuice\n- AWMLGaming\n- oChocolate\n- SnaveSutit\n- SamGladiator\n- Sebushtin Bush\n- Lolgan\n- Ktsnii\n- Tem4ik\n- AshIsReal\n- AnimalMace\n- Tito_Lootlabs\n- IamMaker\n- Seagoleri\n- CookieBunsquat\n- Powpow\n- Knarfy\n- Mayor05\n- iCats\n\n-------------------------------\n\n**Go Watch the Video!**   \n![Chibi Player Model](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a47f368deba7f284ccb52eacfbdcbede3d4c4be.gif)![sans walk](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/04bc12b8e11a1aa011789c66cbd2d57dac7a96ea.gif)",
